{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2a39a10c9a6c8d4a","name":"Force Hunter Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-2a39a10c9a6c8d4a","title":"Force Hunter Talent Tree","revision":20160,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:19:46Z","sha256":"0c13b6938a3d282b395992ca73b29534b3115745c544d2de49f6d39448a8c198","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20160","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Force%20Hunter%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2a39a10c9a6c8d4a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Hunting Jedi is big business during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Legacy Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Legacy_Era"},", as the Sith-controlled Empire pays well for captured Jedi. However, given their powers and skills, Jedi are among the most dangerous prey for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bounty Hunters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bounty_Hunters"}," to pursue.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Blank"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You are especially hard to detect using ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Attempts to detect you using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Surroundings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Surroundings"}," aspect of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill suffer a -10 penalty.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Lightsaber Evasion"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever an enemy misses you with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", you may ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to 2 squares in any direction. This movement does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Precision Fire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Jedi are skilled at blocking and deflecting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b"}," with their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", and you are able to compensate for this to some degree by taking careful shots. Whenever you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," before making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", you increase the difficulty of ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," attempts to negate your attack by +5.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Steel Mind"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you resist the effects of a [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mind-Affecting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind-Affecting"}]},"] Force Power, the user of that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," cannot attempt to use the same ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," against you for the remainder of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Strong-Willed"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You are trained to resist Jedi mind tricks. You add your Class Level to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Telekinetic Resistance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you are targeted by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," that moves you, you reduce the distance you are moved by half.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
